{"title":"TeXeR","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Texer is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27bb8d5acf15ea850c966cc6b82b448f35681a19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{\\LaTeX}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> editor in AoPS. The link is <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/texer/\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/texer/</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Buttons\">Buttons</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TeXeR&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Buttons\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Image: There are 20 lines of additional crud prepending to the input before TeX rendering, meaning the line number in errors are 20 lines ahead of the actual line, e.g. an error on line 23 is actually an error on line 3.\n</p><p>BBcode: Normal in comments (missing stuff is not told)\n</p><p>MathJax: Renders when you stop typing. No Asy.\n</p><p>PDF: For printing\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=TeXeR&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018111721\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 14/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 256/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 183/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.757      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.757      1 -total\n